---
description: Replace unsuitable scenario cues while preserving the competency and target decision.
args: { dossier: LearningDossier; change: AdaptationChange; kernels: CompetencyKernel[]; fit: AudienceFit[] }
returns: AdaptedScenario[]
---
When the analogy is unfamiliar, replace that analogy with an evidenced, comprehensible context while retaining the same decision objective. Preserve the competency, consequences and relevant ambiguity. Do not choose a culturally stereotyped example; where context support is disputed, provide bounded alternatives for reviewer choice.
